# DESK05 run E -- the rewired `lookup_ascii_shortcut` still fires.
# Ctrl-S = `Save desktop...` (slot 30 of menu_shortcuts, default 'S'); the
# lookup now walks the array through `shortcut_mapping[]` instead of a
# hard-coded match, so this is the regression check for that rewrite.
# IKBD: CTRL make 1D, S make 1F, S break 9F, CTRL break 9D.
100 parkbr
300 move 600 240
1000 arm
1400 mark A_IDLE
1700 key 1d
1730 key 1f
1760 key 9f
1790 key 9d
3000 mark B_AFTER_CTRL_S
